    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Taking notes",
     "texto": [
      "**Notiță** is \"short note\". **Ideea principală** names the central message; the **cuvintele-cheie** let you recognise it afterwards."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Selecting",
     "texto": [
      "**A omite** means \"to omit\". When summarising, you can remove secondary examples, but not a condition that changes the conclusion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
